  "result": "{\"seen_before\": true, \"matches\": [\"PowerToys#21313\", \"PowerToys#28596\", \"PowerToys#42868\"], \"answer\": \"This keyboard-cleaning-mode request has been filed before. The main ticket is PowerToys#21313, which asks for a utility that disables the keyboard (and optionally mouse/touchscreen) while cleaning. PowerToys#28596 and #42868 request the same thing, and #29382 was closed as a duplicate. In those tickets the PowerToys team said they have no plans to implement it (\\\"just lock the computer or turn it off\\\"). Suggested workarounds from those tickets: lock the PC (Win+L) or put it to sleep, unplug a USB keyboard, turn off Bluetooth or remove batteries for a wireless one, or use a third-party keyboard-lock tool (for example, the keyboard clean tool from folivora.ai mentioned in #21313). You can add a +1 to #21313 to show demand.\"}",
